    "answer": {
      "short": "1250 people",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Total surveyed} &= 49+19+135+13 \\\\ \\text{Total surveyed} &= 216 \\\\ \\text{Relative frequency of Rugby League} &= \\frac{135}{216} \\\\ \\text{Expected frequency} &= \\text{Relative frequency}\\times\\text{Total trials} \\\\ \\text{Expected frequency} &= \\frac{135}{216}\\times2000 \\\\ \\text{Expected frequency} &= 1250\\end{align*}$$\nAbout 1250 people would choose Rugby League.",
